# Echo is a static site (the web mirror of the Echo competitor-intel app).
# Nothing here is built, and nothing secret belongs in it. Each user signs in with
# their own Google account and enters their own Gemini key at runtime, stored only in
# their own browser — so no key, token, or credential may ever appear in this repo.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# The OAuth *client ID* is public by design and DOES ship in the page (like Sightline).
# But never commit a client secret, an API key, a keystore, or a .env.
.env
*.keystore
*.jks

# Internal working documents live alongside this repo in ../Echo docs/, not inside it.
# Listed here so dropping a copy back in does not quietly publish it.
PRD.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
DESIGN.md
PROMPTING.md
RULES.md
MEMORY.md
README-full.md

# Scratch copies and local preview harnesses. These are working files, and the whole point of
# this repo is that only what is meant to be published ends up published.
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
_preview.html
_fixture.json
_chk.js

# Layout studies. Useful while choosing a direction, dead weight once it is chosen, and nothing
# in the app ever links to them — so they stay on the machine and out of the published site.
mockups.html
sync-mockups.html

# Source art. The shipped icons are generated FROM these; the originals are not served, and
# logo.svg is the only mark the app or the worker actually asks for.
logo.png
Echo logo.png
